  m_Name: Note_GardenStewCard
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: GrandmasHouse::GrandmasHouse.Data.NoteData
  kind: 1
  title: Garden Stew
  recipe: {fileID: 0}
  body: '(stand-in until Grandma''s own card is added)


    Garden Stew


    Potatoes
    and winter squash, cut up

    Carrots and an onion

    2 or 3 tomatoes, quartered

    Water
    and a scoop of salt


    Use whatever the garden gives you. The more kinds in
    the pot, the better it holds you. Boil it good and long.'
  marginNote: Squash and potatoes from the cellar keep all winter. Use the soft ones
    first.
